                                "sense_id": "4b3cd9f9-9c10-3737-9171-f7637c5b139e",
                                "text": "“I have tickets for the train to New York tonight. Hurry up, Molly! Don’t stand there gawping.”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "849bb8a2-b775-4d6d-8b96-6d56f9cb1376",
                                "sense_id": "4b3cd9f9-9c10-3737-9171-f7637c5b139e",
                                "text": "The lady looked around to see that there were hundreds of sets of eyes staring back at her. Even the screaming toddlers had momentarily stopped screaming and were gawping."
